%description:

Tcp.initialSsthresh:low -- slow start ends at the threshold, and the window then grows slowly.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "the first slow-start threshold of each algorithm with slow start, in
bytes".

The classes: high (the default 4294967295, "arbitrarily high"), low (a value that slow start
reaches), invalid (0, or above 4294967295). The code: the algorithms read it at the start
(TcpClassicAlgorithmBase, TcpTahoe, TcpVegas, TcpWestwood), and TcpAlgorithmBase checks it. This test separates "low" from "high".

Host under test: host1, with 8000, which sends 100000 bytes without a loss; the round trip is
40 ms. Observation: level 2, the largest value of the signal cwnd stays below 30000 bytes,
because above 8000 bytes the window grows by about one segment for each round trip.

%# parameter: Tcp.initialSsthresh
%# class: low
%# value: 8000
%# key: *.host1.tcp.initialSsthresh
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpInitialSsthreshLow")
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == true && tcp.ackBit == false")
             .capture("isn", "tcp.sequenceNo")
             .describe("the SYN of host1")
             .within(0.5))
        .meanwhile(anyNumberOfTimes(on("host1.tcp").signal("cwnd")
                                        .captureMax("largestCwnd", "value")
                                        .within(3.0)))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.ackNo == {isn} + 100001")
             .first()
                  .assertPacket("{largestCwnd} < 30000")
             .describe("the ACK of the last byte, after a congestion window below 30000 bytes")
             .within(3.0));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpInitialSsthreshLow compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.initialSsthresh = 8000    # the parameter under test
*.linkDelay = 10ms
*.host1.app[0].sendBytes = 100000B
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpInitialSsthreshLow: PASS
